 convert every 1% extra Attack Speed into 1 .","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b08818fe1736239ae3be7cf2d2dabf08.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":8210,"name":"Revenge Strike","description":"Terizla strikes the ground with his hammer, sending a fissure forward that deals 300 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Upon hitting its first target, the fissure burrows into them, slowing them by 15%. Terizla also gains 15% Movement Speed for 3.5s.\n\nThe fissure then explodes, dealing 300 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 20% of the target's lost ) Physical Damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_75648daf275c81c11c68d0dc99ded14a.png","video":null,"cd":8.5,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Speed Up","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":8220,"name":"Execution Strike","description":"Terizla swings his hammer in a fan-shaped area ahead. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The first two attacks deal 90 (+135% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage each, while the third deals 225 (+220% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Enemies hit will also be slowed by 20% for 1.25s (the Slowing Effect can stack).\nDeals only 80% damage to Minions.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0edb37acc50cca6239a839bdb96fea5c.png","video":null,"cd":9.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":8230,"name":"Penalty Zone","description":"Terizla jumps to the designated area, dealing 300 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking enemies airborne for 0.6s. He then summons Scaffold and slows enemies by 25%. Scaffold will send out a hook at enemy heroes in range and pull them several times while dealing 150 (+30% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage each time.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da9efd3bc3382173ceef6d14503894a2.png","video":null,"cd":50.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Terizla works best with heroes who have strong initiation skills that allow him to deal more damage with his skills, heroes like Gatotkaca and Atlas are good examples here.","heroes":[{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"},{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Terizla is strong against light melee fighters cause they'll have a hard time surviving his heavy skill damage, such as Zilong and Sun.","heroes":[{"id":16,"name":"Zilong","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9db57da4f0daef6d432676e4f19101ed.png"},{"id":27,"name":"Sun","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_117b5cdcc13232157075ce7b7f6177e9.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Terizla is countered by heroes with good Mobility or long attack range, because it will be diffcult to hit them with his skills. Such as Arlott and Lesley.","heroes":[{"id":120,"name":"Arlott","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f666faa5ec6be5353f10dcd1d8997a42.png"},{"id":53,"name":"Lesley","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_08770893183018333f54a98e63c41ee3.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Terizla","skins":[{"name":"Hammer Giant","name_slug":"Hammer-Giant","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/terizla/Terizla-Hammer-Giant-20201027120126.webp","image_fil